DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The BBUUSS__GGEETT__PPRROOPPEERRTTYY() method is called from driver code which wants to
     access a child's specific data stored on the bus.  A property has a name
     and an associated value.  Implementation shall copy to _p_r_o_p_v_a_l_u_e at most
     _s_i_z_e bytes.

     BBUUSS__GGEETT__PPRROOPPEERRTTYY() supports different property types specified via the
     _t_y_p_e argument.  The _s_i_z_e is guaranteed to be a multiple of the underlying
     property type.  If a type is not supported, BBUUSS__GGEETT__PPRROOPPEERRTTYY() shall re‐
     turn -1.

NNOOTTEESS
     If _p_r_o_p_v_a_l_u_e is NULL or _s_i_z_e is zero, the implementation shall return
     only the size of the property.

